{
  "name": "Run consent-based SMS marketing campaigns from Google Sheets with RCSZilla",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SMS Marketing Automation\n\nThis workflow runs a consent-based SMS marketing campaign from Google Sheets and queues personalized messages through RCSZilla.\n\nIt is designed for local businesses, ecommerce stores, service providers, agencies, events, and teams that need a simple campaign sender with consent checks, dedupe, pacing, logging, and opt-out capture.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0cb8885e-2a28-4f2b-9dd1-2f0ef0f84f12",
      "name": "Workflow overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -980,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup Guide\n\n1. Install community node: n8n-nodes-rcszilla.\n2. Create credentials for Google Sheets and RCSZilla.\n3. Create a Google Sheet with tabs named Contacts, Send Log, and Opt Outs.\n4. In the Google Sheets nodes, replace PASTE_SMS_MARKETING_SHEET_ID with your sheet ID.\n5. Add test contacts with consent = yes before using real customers.\n6. Review the campaign settings inside Prepare campaign messages.\n7. Run Start SMS campaign manually, check Send Log, then activate only when your process is ready.\n\nOnly message contacts who gave clear SMS marketing consent.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "71d62363-e56e-41f6-8477-70d27c579b0b",
      "name": "Setup guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -980,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Contacts Sheet Columns\n\nRecommended Contacts columns:\n\nphone, first_name, last_name, consent, opt_out, segment, campaign_status, send_after, offer_text, offer_url, message_template\n\nRequired:\n\nphone: recipient number with country code\nconsent: yes or true\ncampaign_status: leave blank before sending\n\nOptional:\n\nopt_out: yes skips the contact\nsegment: limits campaigns by audience\ncampaign_status is updated to queued after a successful RCSZilla queue call\nsend_after: future date/time before the contact is eligible\nmessage_template: supports {{first_name}}, {{offer_text}}, and {{offer_url}}",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "e7235b9d-5cc3-4ad7-b67b-d6945ab0eac8",
      "name": "Contacts sheet format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -980,
        500
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Compliance Notes\n\nThis workflow is for permission-based SMS marketing.\n\nIt rejects contacts without consent, skips opt-outs, adds Reply STOP to the message, deduplicates phone numbers, limits send volume per run, and spaces scheduled messages so you do not blast every contact at the same second.\n\nKeep consent records outside this workflow. Do not use purchased lists or unsolicited contacts.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "c7fc5366-99bc-4ddd-9566-4f92f57382ab",
      "name": "Compliance notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -300,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Opt-Out Capture\n\nThe opt-out webhook accepts inbound reply payloads such as:\n\n{\n  \"from\": \"+40700000000\",\n  \"message\": \"STOP\",\n  \"source\": \"RCSZilla\"\n}\n\nSTOP, UNSUBSCRIBE, CANCEL, END, and QUIT are saved to the Opt Outs tab.\n\nUse the Opt Outs tab to update your Contacts opt_out column before the next campaign run.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b9bc0a19-fc83-452c-a4ed-75a22f41bb58",
      "name": "Opt-out webhook guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
